  "description": "<p><strong>Ludo Classic: Roll the Dice!</strong></p><p>Relive the timeless fun of Ludo, reimagined for your screen! Gather your friends and family for this classic board game of strategy, luck, and a race to the finish line.</p><p><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Classic Ludo Gameplay:</strong> Roll the dice, move your pawns, and navigate the board to get all your pieces home before your opponents.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Multiplayer Fun:</strong> Play with 2, 3, or 4 players in a single game.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Play Your Way:</strong> Challenge your friends in local multiplayer or test your skills against our smart AI opponents. Customize each player to be human or AI.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Exciting Rules:</strong> Get an extra turn when you roll a six or capture an opponent's pawn!</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Polished Experience:</strong> Enjoy smooth animations, satisfying sound effects, and a clean, modern interface that makes playing a joy.</li></ol><p>Will you be the first to get all your pawns to safety? There's only one way to find out. Roll the dice and become the Ludo champion!</p>",
  "instructions": "Instructions: 1. Use A/D keys to move left/right (desktop) or joystick (mobile) 2. Press SPACE or W to jump (desktop) or jump button (mobile) 3. Click to shoot (desktop) or tap to shoot (mobile) 4. Press R to reload when out of ammo 5. Collect powerups from enemies and use UI buttons to activate them 6. Collect diamonds for points 7. Start at bottom-left, reach the portal at top-right to advance levels",
